    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/bb53c083a8fc996344f22432922b392a.poster.avif?t=1728508586\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/bb53c083a8fc996344f22432922b392a.webm?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/bb53c083a8fc996344f22432922b392a.mp4?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paw Rescuers</strong> is a <strong>cozy</strong> <strong>multiplayer</strong> <strong>open-world</strong> game packed with fun and adventure! Whether you're playing solo or with friends, explore a huge world where you can gather resources, craft tools, and build anything from homes to factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, caves, and mountains, and experience cool weather changes and a day-night cycle. Your mission? Rescue and collect cute animals, then team up with them to protect their kingdom from AI bots trying to take over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/cd3429dcbc9bee537dfc0cc102a274ae.poster.avif?t=1728508586\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/cd3429dcbc9bee537dfc0cc102a274ae.webm?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/cd3429dcbc9bee537dfc0cc102a274ae.mp4?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tPlay solo or with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tExplore a massive open world full of caves, forests, and mountains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tWeather system with day-night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tGather resources and mine for materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCraft tools and build homes, factories, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCollect adorable animals and fight alongside them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCustomize your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/8d90c1b8dc5151ec0df8c4949372a517.poster.avif?t=1728508586\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/8d90c1b8dc5151ec0df8c4949372a517.webm?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/8d90c1b8dc5151ec0df8c4949372a517.mp4?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re still working on the game, so hop into our Discord (<u>link on the right side of this page</u>) to share your ideas and help shape <i>Paw Rescuers</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and stay tuned!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/bb53c083a8fc996344f22432922b392a.poster.avif?t=1728508586\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/bb53c083a8fc996344f22432922b392a.webm?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/bb53c083a8fc996344f22432922b392a.mp4?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paw Rescuers</strong> is a <strong>cozy</strong> <strong>multiplayer</strong> <strong>open-world</strong> game packed with fun and adventure! Whether you're playing solo or with friends, explore a huge world where you can gather resources, craft tools, and build anything from homes to factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, caves, and mountains, and experience cool weather changes and a day-night cycle. Your mission? Rescue and collect cute animals, then team up with them to protect their kingdom from AI bots trying to take over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/cd3429dcbc9bee537dfc0cc102a274ae.poster.avif?t=1728508586\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/cd3429dcbc9bee537dfc0cc102a274ae.webm?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/cd3429dcbc9bee537dfc0cc102a274ae.mp4?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tPlay solo or with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tExplore a massive open world full of caves, forests, and mountains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tWeather system with day-night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tGather resources and mine for materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCraft tools and build homes, factories, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCollect adorable animals and fight alongside them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\tCustomize your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/8d90c1b8dc5151ec0df8c4949372a517.poster.avif?t=1728508586\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/8d90c1b8dc5151ec0df8c4949372a517.webm?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/8d90c1b8dc5151ec0df8c4949372a517.mp4?t=1728508586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re still working on the game, so hop into our Discord (<u>link on the right side of this page</u>) to share your ideas and help shape <i>Paw Rescuers</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and stay tuned!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Paw Rescuers is a cozy multiplayer open-world game packed with adventures. Craft tools, mine resources, and build homes and factories. Explore a vast world with friends and rescue adorable animals along the way!",
